{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Ref. '5.4 Database/Tabell Design' in report.\n## Building the Cassandra database\n___\n**Note**  \nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:\n1. [1_Capstone_CQL_DB_Build.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n2. [2_Capstone_Frame_to_Table.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n3. [3_Capstone_Cassandra_Queries.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n___\nThis notebook is created with the intention of being a single run document to build the CQL database with keyspaces and tables that fulfill the requirement to complete the assigned CQL related tasks for \"Capstone\" in the project assigment.  \nIt's worth mentioning that all builds are structured with a `IF NOT EXISTS` solution. This means that the entire notebook can be run several times and will not fail on build jobs where a **table** or **keyspace** with a matching name already exists. This is done with the intention of giving a opportunity to re-run the entire notebook if it were to fail at a certain stage in a full run.  \n\nThe following actions will be executed on a full run of this notebook:  \n- Create a keyspace to contain the tables.\n- Create tables that resonates with the hypothesis created for the capstone data:\n1. Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad gjennom én time er høyest i rushtiden hverdager mellom 15:00 og 16:00.\n2. Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er lavere i juli måned enn for resten av året.\n3. Det finnes en positiv korrelasjon for temperatur og total sykkeltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10:00 og 14:00.\n4. Det finnes en negativ korrelasjon for temperatur og total biltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10:00 og 14:00.\n5. Data kan benyttes til å forutsi om det er blitt utført veiarbeid eller vedlikehold på et gitt trafikk registreringspunkt basert på uregelmessigheter i trafikkmålinger.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Ref. &lsquo;5.4 Database/Tabell Design&rsquo; in report.</h1>\n<h2>Building the Cassandra database</h2>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Note</strong><br />\nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">1_Capstone_CQL_DB_Build.zpln</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">2_Capstone_Frame_to_Table.zpln</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">3_Capstone_Cassandra_Queries.zpln</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<p>This notebook is created with the intention of being a single run document to build the CQL database with keyspaces and tables that fulfill the requirement to complete the assigned CQL related tasks for &ldquo;Capstone&rdquo; in the project assigment.<br />\nIt&rsquo;s worth mentioning that all builds are structured with a <code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> solution. This means that the entire notebook can be run several times and will not fail on build jobs where a <strong>table</strong> or <strong>keyspace</strong> with a matching name already exists. This is done with the intention of giving a opportunity to re-run the entire notebook if it were to fail at a certain stage in a full run.</p>\n<p>The following actions will be executed on a full run of this notebook:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create a keyspace to contain the tables.</li>\n<li>Create tables that resonates with the hypothesis created for the capstone data:</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad gjennom én time er høyest i rushtiden hverdager mellom 15:00 og 16:00.</li>\n<li>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er lavere i juli måned enn for resten av året.</li>\n<li>Det finnes en positiv korrelasjon for temperatur og total sykkeltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10:00 og 14:00.</li>\n<li>Det finnes en negativ korrelasjon for temperatur og total biltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10:00 og 14:00.</li>\n<li>Data kan benyttes til å forutsi om det er blitt utført veiarbeid eller vedlikehold på et gitt trafikk registreringspunkt basert på uregelmessigheter i trafikkmålinger.</li>\n</ol>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395687_856116424","id":"paragraph_1762981309943_1952021603","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n## Ref. '5.2 Keyspace' in report.\n### Creating the keyspace.\nThis cell creates a keyspace named `capstone_ks` which contains a collection of the custom tables for Capstone related querie assignments.  \nBefore tables can be created in *Cassandra*, a *keyspace* must be defined. A keyspace serves as a container for tables and specifies the replication strategy for the data.\nIn this project, a keyspace named **capstone_ks** is created with a simple replication strategy that replicates the data on a single node, which is suitable for development and testing environments.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;5.2 Keyspace&rsquo; in report.</h2>\n<h3>Creating the keyspace.</h3>\n<p>This cell creates a keyspace named <code>capstone_ks</code> which contains a collection of the custom tables for Capstone related querie assignments.<br />\nBefore tables can be created in <em>Cassandra</em>, a <em>keyspace</em> must be defined. A keyspace serves as a container for tables and specifies the replication strategy for the data.<br />\nIn this project, a keyspace named <strong>capstone_ks</strong> is created with a simple replication strategy that replicates the data on a single node, which is suitable for development and testing environments.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395690_1988155388","id":"paragraph_1763114296656_679064927","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%cassandra\r\nCREATE KEYSPACE IF NOT EXISTS capstone_ks\r\nWITH replication = {\r\n    'class' : 'SimpleStrategy',\r\n    'replication_factor' : 1\r\n};","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#bd9ee501-9ff9-409a-819e-2c61c02a715f\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"bd9ee501-9ff9-409a-819e-2c61c02a715f\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE KEYSPACE IF NOT EXISTS capstone_ks\r\nWITH replication = {\r\n    'class' : 'SimpleStrategy',\r\n    'replication_factor' : 1\r\n};</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Tried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Queried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Schema in Agreement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">true</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395691_427909024","id":"paragraph_1762894754977_2127378393","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\r\n## Ref. '5.4 Database/Tabell Design' in report.\r\n### Bulding tables\r\nThe following cells create the tables which are designed to fit the specific hypothesis and the related queries, which can be found in [3_Capstone_Cassandra_Queries.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone).    \r\nThis section covers the design of the Cassandra database.\r\nThe tables created here are based on the fully processed DataFrame produced in Section 4.2.\r\nThe design and structure of the tables are shaped to support the queries described in Section 5.3, which in turn are aligned with the hypotheses presented in Subsection 4.1.3.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Ref. &lsquo;5.4 Database/Tabell Design&rsquo; in report.</h2>\n<h3>Bulding tables</h3>\n<p>The following cells create the tables which are designed to fit the specific hypothesis and the related queries, which can be found in <a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">3_Capstone_Cassandra_Queries.zpln</a>.<br />\nThis section covers the design of the Cassandra database.<br />\nThe tables created here are based on the fully processed DataFrame produced in Section 4.2.<br />\nThe design and structure of the tables are shaped to support the queries described in Section 5.3, which in turn are aligned with the hypotheses presented in Subsection 4.1.3.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395692_142683394","id":"paragraph_1762981302717_978838562","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Hypothesis 1\nDen totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad gjennom én time er høyest i rushtiden hverdager mellom 15 : 00 og 16 : 00.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Hypothesis 1</h3>\n<p>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad gjennom én time er høyest i rushtiden hverdager mellom 15 : 00 og 16 : 00.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395693_1221492319","id":"paragraph_1763114931678_865357795","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:43+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Description\nThe purpose of this table is to store traffic data for each hour of the day, enabling analysis of traffic patterns during rush hours.\nHere, we are interested in location, date, weekday, time, and traffic volume.\nThe content of this table is partitioned by **navn** to efficiently retrieve data for specific traffic monitoring points.\nEach partition is then ordered by **dato** and **fra** (start time) to support time-based queries within each location without requiring additional filtering in the queries.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Description</h4>\n<p>The purpose of this table is to store traffic data for each hour of the day, enabling analysis of traffic patterns during rush hours.<br />\nHere, we are interested in location, date, weekday, time, and traffic volume.<br />\nThe content of this table is partitioned by <strong>navn</strong> to efficiently retrieve data for specific traffic monitoring points.<br />\nEach partition is then ordered by <strong>dato</strong> and <strong>fra</strong> (start time) to support time-based queries within each location without requiring additional filtering in the queries.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395693_2105293001","id":"paragraph_1763975229912_2067456244","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE capstone_ks;\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS rushtid(\n    navn TEXT,\n    dato DATE,\n    ukedag TEXT,\n    fra TINYINT,\n    til TINYINT,\n    trafikkmengde SMALLINT,\nPRIMARY KEY (navn, dato, fra, trafikkmengde)\n) WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (dato ASC, fra ASC);","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#1525db41-25f2-43cf-8c9a-357f72d638cd\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"1525db41-25f2-43cf-8c9a-357f72d638cd\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS rushtid(\n    navn TEXT,\n    dato DATE,\n    ukedag TEXT,\n    fra TINYINT,\n    til TINYINT,\n    trafikkmengde SMALLINT,\nPRIMARY KEY (navn, dato, fra, trafikkmengde)\n) WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (dato ASC, fra ASC);</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Tried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Queried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Schema in Agreement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">true</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395694_1811089724","id":"paragraph_1762979804748_1640673882","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Hypothesis 2\nDen totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er lavere i juli måned enn for resten av året.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Hypothesis 2</h3>\n<p>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er lavere i juli måned enn for resten av året.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395694_2025262009","id":"paragraph_1762981286433_323942182","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Description\nThis table has a similar structure to the table in Hypothesis 1 but is designed to store aggregated monthly traffic data.\nHere, we are interested in year, month, location, and traffic volume.\nThe content of this table is partitioned by **navn** to efficiently retrieve data for specific traffic monitoring points.\nEach partition is then ordered by **year** and **month** to enable time-based queries within each location without requiring additional filtering in the queries.\nThe values for **trafikkmengde** are aggregated during the data export process from *Spark* to *Cassandra*.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Description</h4>\n<p>This table has a similar structure to the table in Hypothesis 1 but is designed to store aggregated monthly traffic data.<br />\nHere, we are interested in year, month, location, and traffic volume.<br />\nThe content of this table is partitioned by <strong>navn</strong> to efficiently retrieve data for specific traffic monitoring points.<br />\nEach partition is then ordered by <strong>year</strong> and <strong>month</strong> to enable time-based queries within each location without requiring additional filtering in the queries.<br />\nThe values for <strong>trafikkmengde</strong> are aggregated during the data export process from <em>Spark</em> to <em>Cassandra</em>.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395695_857780643","id":"paragraph_1763975236121_574267694","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE capstone_KS;\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS trafikkmengde_mnd(\n    yr INT,\n    mnd TINYINT,\n    navn TEXT,\n    trafikkmengde BIGINT,\nPRIMARY KEY (navn, yr, mnd, trafikkmengde)\n) WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (yr ASC, mnd ASC);","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#d3f9f82c-4d4c-4db6-a527-5691be53f175\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"d3f9f82c-4d4c-4db6-a527-5691be53f175\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS trafikkmengde_mnd(\n    yr INT,\n    mnd TINYINT,\n    navn TEXT,\n    trafikkmengde BIGINT,\nPRIMARY KEY (navn, yr, mnd, trafikkmengde)\n) WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (yr ASC, mnd ASC);</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Tried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Queried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Schema in Agreement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">true</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395695_1758795659","id":"paragraph_1762981114973_541321311","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Hypothesis 3\nDet finnes en positiv korrelasjon for temperatur og total sykkeltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10 : 00 − 14 : 00.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Hypothesis 3</h3>\n<p>Det finnes en positiv korrelasjon for temperatur og total sykkeltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10 : 00 − 14 : 00.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395695_1055655384","id":"paragraph_1763580271495_1533711488","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Description\nThe purpose of this table is to store bicycle traffic data together with corresponding air temperature in order to analyse the correlation between these variables.\nHere, we are interested in location, date, time, bicycle traffic volume, and air temperature.\nThe content of this table is partitioned by **navn** to efficiently retrieve data for specific traffic monitoring points.\nTo answer the hypothesis and analyse the correlation, we need to extract hourly data across entire days, enabling comparisons between the hypothesis’ reference period and other time intervals.\nEach partition is then ordered by **dato** to support time-based queries within each location without requiring additional filtering in the queries.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Description</h4>\n<p>The purpose of this table is to store bicycle traffic data together with corresponding air temperature in order to analyse the correlation between these variables.<br />\nHere, we are interested in location, date, time, bicycle traffic volume, and air temperature.<br />\nThe content of this table is partitioned by <strong>navn</strong> to efficiently retrieve data for specific traffic monitoring points.<br />\nTo answer the hypothesis and analyse the correlation, we need to extract hourly data across entire days, enabling comparisons between the hypothesis’ reference period and other time intervals.<br />\nEach partition is then ordered by <strong>dato</strong> to support time-based queries within each location without requiring additional filtering in the queries.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1765678395696_632461768","id":"paragraph_1763975240068_1213871475","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T02:13:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","dateFinished":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE capstone_ks;\n\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS sykkel_temp_corr(\n    navn TEXT,\n    dato DATE,\n    fra TINYINT,\n    til TINYINT,    \n    trafikkmengde SMALLINT,\n    lufttemperatur FLOAT,\nPRIMARY KEY (navn, dato, fra)\n)WITH CLUSTERING ORDER BY (dato ASC);","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-12-14T02:14:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#72007d09-6504-48e1-a584-eeba381007aa\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"72007d09-6504-48e1-a584-eeba381007aa\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS sykkel_temp_corr(\n    navn TEXT,\n    dato DATE,\n